{
  "id": "2SA.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Sam 19",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yowabu ŵajamwice Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowabu ŵapikene kuti, “Mwenye akulila malilo ga Abisalomu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cisangalalo ca lisiku lyeleli caŵele malilo kwa ŵandu wosope, pakuti ŵandu ŵapikene kuti, “Mwenye ali ni canasa cejinji ligongo lya mwanagwawo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku lyeleli ŵandu ŵajinjilaga mu msinda mwangatenda lisegwe, mpela mwakwinjililaga ŵandu mu msinda mwa soni, ali mkutila ku ngondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye ŵaliwunicile ku ngope ni ŵalilaga mwakwesya maloŵe kuti, “Mwanangu Abisalomu, m'mwe Abisalomu, mwanangu, mwanangu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowabu ŵajinjile m'nyumba muŵaliji mwenye ni ŵatite, “Ŵatesisye soni ŵa ngondo ŵawo ŵele ŵiŵakulupwisye umi wawo soni umi wa ŵanace wawo ŵacilume ni ŵacakongwe, umi wa aciŵamkwawo ni acakongwe ŵane ŵapadela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligongo lyakuti wawo akwanonyela ŵandu ŵakwaŵenga, ni kwaŵenga ŵandu ŵakwanonyela wawo. Lelo ni atulosisye pakulanguka kuti acimlongola ŵa ngondo ni ŵandu ŵane ŵa ngondo ŵangali nawo kandu. Nambo ngumanyilila kuti Abisalomu akaŵe ciŵela umi, uwe wosope ni kuwa, wawo akasangalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo sambano akopoce, ajawule akalimbisye mitima ŵa ngondo ŵawo mwakwasangalasya. Nditu ngulumbila pali AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kuti, naga ngajawula wosope tiŵatile cilo cino. Ni yeleyi yicasakalisya mnope kupunda yakusakala yiyawonecele kalakala, kutandila ali mwanace mpaka lelo jino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyejo ŵajimwice, ni ŵapite kutama pasi pakuŵandikana ni cipata. Ŵandu wosope piŵapikene kuti mwenye ali ku cipata, ŵayice pameso pa mwenyejo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi akuwujila soni ku Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku lyeleli ni kuti Aisalaeli ali atisile, jwalijose jwapite kumangwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa mitundu josope ja Aisalaeli ŵaliji mkukangana acimsyenepe. Ŵatiji, “Mwenye Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵatuwombwele kwa amagongo ŵetu soni ŵatukulupwisye kwa Afilisiti. Nambo lelo akopwece mcilambo cino, kutila Abisalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisalomu ŵitwasagwile pakwapakasya mawuta kuti aŵe mwenye ŵetu, ŵawile ku ngondo. Ana ligongo cici sambano ngakuŵeceta cindu cilicose cakwayana yakuja kwajigala Mwenye Daudi kuti awujile soni?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Daudi ŵatumisye utenga kwa Sadoki ni Abiyatala, ŵambopesi kuti, “Mwawusye acimlongola ŵa ku Yuda kuti, ‘Ana ligongo cici jemanja akukokoŵa kwawula kukwajigala mwenye kuti awujile ku nyumba jawo, pakuti Aisalaeli wosope ŵatumisye kala maloŵe kwa mwenye kuti mwenyejo awujile ku nyumba jakwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanja ni acalongo acimjangu asyesyene. Ana ligongo cici jemanja akusaka kuti aŵe ŵakumalisya kwaŵilanga mwenye?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkasalile Amasa kuti, ‘Ana m'mwe ngaŵa mlongo mjangu msyesyene?’ Kusyene Mlungu anjamuce mpaka mbwe, naga ngangumŵika m'mwejo kuŵa jwamkulungwa jwa ngondo kwinjila m'malo mwa Yowabu kutandila sambano jino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Daudi ŵakopile Ayuda wosope kuŵa ŵawo, nipo ŵakamulene cindu cimo. Mwamti ŵanduwo ŵatumisye utenga kwa mwenye kuti, “Awujile pamo ni ŵa ngondo ŵawo wosope.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni pelepo mwenye ŵawujile ku Yolodani. Soni ŵandu wosope ŵa mtundu wa Ayuda ŵayice ku Giligala kuwonegana ni mwenye ni kukwajombosya Yolodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nombe Shimeyi, mwanace jwa Gela, M'benjamini jwa ku Bahulimu, jwayice mwakwanguya pamo ni ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda kuti akasimane ni Mwenye Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.16.5+2SA.16.6+2SA.16.7+2SA.16.8+2SA.16.9+2SA.16.10+2SA.16.11+2SA.16.12+2SA.16.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 16:5-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵaliji ni ŵandu 1,000 ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini. Siba jwakutumicila jwa liŵasa lwa Saulo, pamo ni ŵanace likumi ni msano ŵacalume ni ŵamasengo ŵakwe makumi gaŵili, ŵawutucile ku Yolodani mkinayice mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ŵajombwesye wosope ŵa liŵasa lya mwenye, ni ŵatesile yosope yiŵasakaga mwenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵamtendele canasa Shimeyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jiŵatiji Mwenye Daudi ajomboce Yolodani, Shimeyi mwanace jwa Gela, ŵaligwicisye pasi pameso pa mwenyejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ŵatite kwa mwenye kuti, “Ambuje ŵangu, conde mungululucile, mkakumbucila soni ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wele une kapolo jwenu unatesile lisiku limwatyokaga mu Yelusalemu lila, conde mwenye kasimyisunga yeleyi mu mtima mwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Une kapolo jwenu ngumanyilila kuti nalemwisye. Ni ligongo lyakwe ambweni yice lelo jino, soni ndili jwandanda mwiŵasa lyosope lya Yosefe kwika kukwacingamila ŵalakwe ambuje ŵangu mwenye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pelepo Abishayi, mwanace jwa Seluya ŵawusisye kuti, “Ana Shimeyiju ngawulajidwa ligongo lyakutukana jwakusagulidwa jwa AMBUJE?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵajanjile kuti, “Pangali cilicose cikwaŵandika jemanja ŵanace ŵa Seluya, akusaŵa mpela ŵagongo ŵangu lelo jino. Ana lelo jino mcilambo ca Aisalaeli cino nikuwulaga mundu? Ana ngangumanyilila kuti une ni mwenye lelo jino jwa Aisalaeli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye ni ŵamsalile Shimeyi kuti, “Ngulumbila kuti m'mwejo Shimeyi ngasimwulajidwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵamtendele canasa Mefiboseti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mefiboseti cisukulu ca Saulo, ŵapite kukuwonegana ni mwenye. Nginacesa ngongolo, nginamyola ndewu, soni nginacapa yakuwala yawo kutandila lisiku lyele mwenye lyatyosile, mpaka lisiku lyawusile mwa mtendele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.1+2SA.9.2+2SA.9.3+2SA.9.4+2SA.9.5+2SA.9.6+2SA.9.7+2SA.9.8+2SA.9.9+2SA.9.10+2SA.9.11+2SA.9.12+2SA.9.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 9:1-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.16.1+2SA.16.2+2SA.16.3+2SA.16.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16:1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵawujaga ku Yelusalemu kuti akawonegane ni mwenye, mwenyejo ŵamwusisye kuti, “M'mwe Mefiboseti, uli nginimjawula pamo ni une?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mefiboseti ŵajanjile kuti, “Une ambuje ŵangu mwenye, Jwamasengo jwangu jwandemwekasisye. Kapolo jwawone, namsalile cenenepe jwamasengojo kuti, ‘Andaŵile cakutamila pa bulu kuti ngwele, njawule pamo ni ŵalakwe mwenye,’ paja une kapolo jwawo jwamlemale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo jwelejo ni ŵanyosisye une kapolo jwawo kwa ŵalakwe ambuje ŵangu mwenye. Nambo wawo ali mpela lilayika lya Mlungu. Ligongo lyakwe sambano, atende yele yiyanonyelesye ŵalakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paja ŵandu wosope ŵa liŵasa lya baba ŵangu akwenela kuwulajidwa ni ŵalakwe ambuje ŵangu mwenye. Nambo une jwakutumicila jwawo ŵambisile pasikati pa ŵandu ŵiŵalyaga ni ŵalakwe pa tebulo jawo. Nambi une mpaka mbe cici cakunjenelesya kuti ndandawule kwa ŵalakwe mwenye?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pelepo mwenye ŵatite, “Basi mbikene mkaŵeceta gane soni maloŵe. Une nganisisye kuti m'mwe ni Siba mgaŵane cipanje ca Saulo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amkunde mjanguju kuti ajigale cipanje cosope,” ŵajanjile myoyo Mefiboseti. “Kwangu kukwanile kuti ŵalakwe ambuje ŵangu mwenye ayice kumangwawo kuno mwamtendele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵamtendele canasa Balisilayi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balisilayi, jwa ku Giliyadi jwayice kutyocela ku Logelimu. Jwapite ni mwenye mpaka ku Yolodani kuti akapecesye komboka Lusulo lwa Yolodani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.17.27+2SA.17.28+2SA.17.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 17:27-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balisilayi jwaliji jwamkalambale, jwa yaka makumi msano ni yitatu. Ni jwapelekaga yakulya kwa mwenye masiku giŵatamaga mwenyewo ku Mahanaimu, pakuti jweleju jwaliji mundu jwakusicila kwejinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo mwenye ŵasalile Balisilayi kuti, “Kwende tujawule yimo, tingamsamale ku Yelusalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Balisilayi ŵawusisye mwenye kuti, “Ana yaka yisigele yilingwa ya une yakutama ni umi, kuti njawule nawo ku Yelusalemu mwenye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano jino yaka yangu yikwanile makumi msano ni yitatu. Ana mpaka ngombole kulekanganya yakunonyelesya? Ana jwakutumicila jwawone mpaka ngombole kumanyilila kunong'a kwa yakulya kapena yakumwa? Ana une mpaka ngombole kupikanila kwimba kwa acalume ni kwa acakongwe? Ana ligongo cici une jwakutumicila jwawo ngaŵe msigo wakusitopa wakwapwatika ŵalakwe, ambuje ŵangu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo jwakutumicila jwawone tinjende panandi kuti njomboce Yolodani pamo ni ŵalakwe mwenye. Ana akumbelaci mtuka wamti myiyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Conde, angunde jwakutumicila jwawone mbujile kuti ngawile ku musi, pakuŵandikana ni malembe ga baba ni mama ŵangu. Nambi aju ngaŵa Kimuhamu mwanangu, aŵe jwakutumicila jwawo. Jweleju ni jutajomboce pamo ni ŵalakwe ambuje ŵangu mwenye. Ni mu mtendele cilicose yele cicanonyelesye ŵalakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mwenyejo ŵajanjile kuti, “Tinjomboce pamo ni Kimuhamu, ni tingamtendele cilicose cele cikwanonyelesya wawo. Soni yosope yakusosa kuti natendele wawo, tinjimtendela.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵandu wosope ŵajomboce Yolodani, mwenye nombe nawo ŵajomboce. Ni mwenyejo ŵampocele Balisilayi ni makono gaŵili, ni ŵampele upile, kaneka Balisilayi jwawujile kumangwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ayuda ni Aisalaeli akukangana ligongo lya mwenye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye ŵajawulagape mpaka kuja kwika ku Giligala, soni Kimuhamu ŵapite nawo. Ŵandu wosope ŵa ku Yuda kwika soni hafu ja ŵandu ŵa ku Aisalaeli, wosope ŵapecesye mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneka Aisalaeli wosope ŵayice kwa mwenye, niŵawusisye kuti, “Ana ligongo cici acalongo acimjetu Ayuda atesile mpela ŵajiŵile, ni kwika ni wawo mwenye pampepe ni liŵasa lyawo ni ŵandu ŵawo wosope, komboka Yolodani?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
